{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DualVerse86 is a retro-futuristic 2D parkour game built for speedrunning, exploration, and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between two parallel virtual worlds, collect floppy disks, and race against the clock in an 80s-inspired digital universe where speed is the only rule. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866770/extras/d54e269969fce0075c3bbc4363015447.poster.avif?t=1752618840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866770/extras/d54e269969fce0075c3bbc4363015447.webm?t=1752618840\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866770/extras/d54e269969fce0075c3bbc4363015447.mp4?t=1752618840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key gameplay features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Precise 2D platforming mixed with fast-paced parkour, set in a retro atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Quickly switch between two worlds to overcome obstacles and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Collect floppy disks to unlock new levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Time-based challenges with medals to earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Hidden secrets to discover in every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Gameplay focused on movement, timing, and precision, no combat involved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Synthwave soundtrack for full immersion in the 80s vibe.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866770/extras/7ebfabff8608220b558cd119bcacbf63.poster.avif?t=1752618840\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866